# Part 3: agentgateway guardrails on kind, delivered by Flux. One artifact per component; every component folder has its own justfile
# (lib/lib.just) with build, validate, push and pin. From here, name the folder: `just platform/routes/build`.
#
#   just <component>/<recipe>                 build, diff, validate, push, pin of one component
#   just <component>/diff [base]              the change against the artifact <base> (default origin/main) pins: what the cluster runs
#   just clusters/kind/up | credentials | down   the kind cluster and the hand-over to Flux (host)
#   just tests/run                            the attack cases against the gateway
#

set quiet

# list the recipes, modules included (the default)
[default]
help:
    just --list --list-submodules
